# Protected files

`manual.pdf` (and any other local hardware manual) is **Ron’s file**. Do not
delete, move, rename, overwrite, or gitignore-widen it. Do not add `*.pdf`.
Ignore only `manual.pdf`.

Never delete or rename a file Ron did not ask you to touch in this chat.
Bulk debrand / cleanup of filenames needs an explicit “yes, rename these
files” first. If a protected file is missing, stop and say so — do not
assume you may recreate or fetch a replacement.
